msgstr "Lubatud"

msgid ""
"Enter the location for your weather forecasts. To include your location, "
"expand your favorites list with 'Manage your favorites'."
msgstr ""
"Sisestage oma ilmaennustuste asukoht. Asukoha lisamiseks täiendage oma "
"lemmikute loendit valikuga 'Halda lemmikuid'."

msgid "Error getting City ID"
msgstr "Viga linna ID hankimisel"

msgid "Error in Weatherinfo"
msgstr "Viga ilmainfos"

